That's simple: just keep offering fresh corpses on the non-co-aligned
altar. Every time you do, your god will fight the current owner of the
altar and chances are that he'll win, and the altar becomes one of your
alignment.

I've also heard it's possible that YOU get converted to a different
alignment, but that's no big deal. Never happened to me, though.

